    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/df/Lumis_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230627013225\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Lumis Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/df/Lumis_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230627013225\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"882\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lumis Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lumis_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>天界枪兵</b>\n</p><p>一位美丽的女战士，是曾降临人间的女神的后裔。她虽年纪轻轻，却有着强烈的自尊心。胜利后，她会以灿烂的笑容迷倒众人。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a6/Lumis_spc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230627013258\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Lumis spc Queen&#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a6/Lumis_spc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230627013258\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"848\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lumis spc Queen&#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lumis_spc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/80/Lumis_CL_Sweets_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260121014702\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Lumis CL Sweets Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/80/Lumis_CL_Sweets_Q